  <data name="InfoTab.AboutText" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>            Stego Revealer - a software suite designed for steganalysis and working with steganographic methods of hiding and extracting information.

            Available steganalysis methods:
                - Comprehensive steganalysis methodology;
                - Chi-Square Attack (CSA);
                - Regular-Singular (RS);
                - Sample Pair Analysis (SPA);
                - Fast Additive Noise (FAN, HCF-COM);
                - Zhilkin Compression Analysis (ZCA);
                - Sequential Koch–Zhao steganalysis (CKZhA).

            Available steganographic extraction methods:
                - LSB method;
                - Koch–Zhao method.

            Developer: Iaroslav Grachev
            Scientific supervisor: V.G. Sidorenko</value>
  </data>
